how to get started  so i got a question for one of my  newsletter readers love you guys  lpr didn't give me the real name lpr  anyway lpr wants to start a new  online business to help people who are  in ontario and quebec do  trail running okay so they're running  through the forest  and he wanted to create a resource an  online place where they can go to  to get all the information needed about  how to do trail running in ontario and  quebec he found that it was  a missing uh thing in the market nobody  was talking about it yet  and so his question to me was should i  do this  right now should i launch it with  whatever i have or should i wait as a  complete resource  and he said he doesn't have time to do  this full time because his wife is going  to freak out on him  what's my advice so lpr this is a very  common problem and i'm really glad you  you wrote and asked about it  first of all it's okay to start  part-time and i encourage it  keep your job do it part-time you'll  keep your wife happy but also you keep  the money coming in because i wouldn't  want you to  quit your job do this for three months  not see results and have to quit and go  back and get a job  the thing is though do something every  day okay something small  even but every day you got to do  something to make this business happen  okay i would definitely launch  as soon as possible something small  something  simple launch as soon as possible  there's a couple reasons for it  one it takes time okay it takes time for  momentum to build  it doesn't just launch a website and  tomorrow you have a million viewers on  it okay it takes  time for it to happen so let that time  build  it's better to launch it small and have  something up there that is still of  value and keep adding to it  than to wait until you have a complete  resource guide  the second thing is you want to get  feedback  from your customer base okay you want to  put something up that's small and then  talk to your friends who are also  interested in trailer running  and get their feedback on it because  then you can  build your website around something that  your customers actually care about  and this is a mistake i made early on in  my career my first software company  the most advanced time consuming feature  in the software  turns out was something that people  don't really care about  only a few people actually cared about  it but most our customers  they didn't care about it now luckily we  had enough other great features in the  software that people would still buy it  but think about how much time we could  have saved and how much of a better  product we could have built  if we took all that energy that went  into creating this one feature that  nobody cared about  and put into something else that's  something that people really did care  about  so i don't want that same thing to  happen to you i want to make sure that  everything you're building is around  customers using your website and saying  wow be really cool if you had this  or this or this so all the features  you're adding in are based on what  people  actually want that will help spread your  momentum and people  feel like they're part of the process  too and say well he added this  just for me this is great they feel  involved and they're more likely to  share it  the last thing i would do is i would  tell your story and put a personal  message up on there  so put your real name on there maybe do  a video if you can get comfortable in  front of the camera  and say why you're launching this  website  what people can hope to expect from it  in the coming months as you  grow it up and that you really want  people's feedback on it  so it gets people to have a personal  connection with you like you are a trail  runner why do you love writing so much  why are you making this  website happen i feel a personal  connection to you  and i also kind of give you a break  because there may not be a lot on there  but i can hear your vision  for what's coming so i know more stuff  is coming i'm going to check in  and i may want to help out and get  involved and give you ideas and give you  suggestions maybe  maybe you need help with pictures or  guides or something else and  seeing that video might inspire me to  want to help you out  so that's what i would do get involved  get momentum  get feedback make the personal video  launch this thing up and when you do  send it to me because i want to check it  out  believe those are watching like the  video thumbs up below  let me know what you think leave a  comment ask a question in the comments  below and i'll make a video response  like this  and you want to see more videos like  this click on my face subscribe to the  channel  thank you so much i'll see you soon  you

